# DESKTOP DESIGN LOCK — FINAL (`desktop-lock-final-2026-08-12`)

**Status:** LOCKED FINAL (2026-08-12). Full write-up: `docs/DESKTOP_LOCK_FINAL.md` · stamp: `DESKTOP_LOCK.json`.

The desktop design (viewport width >= 1025px) of the 9 primary pages —
`public/pages/home.html`, `about.html`, `work.html`, `artists.html`, `artist-path.html`,
`learn-with-tsc.html`, `films.html`, `resources.html`, `academy.html` — is **locked forever**
to the Wix clone baseline (live [Wix Studio site](https://meghanabhawalkarwo.wixstudio.com/my-site)).

Site-wide Wix **motion** (enter / loop / scrub) is also locked to mirrored Thunderbolt payloads —
do not invent timings. Runtime: `tsc-wix-motion.js` + `tsc-wix-authored-motion.js`.

## Zero tolerance

**Forbidden on desktop (>=1025px) unless the owner explicitly requests a desktop visual change:**

- Fonts, font-size overrides, new typefaces
- Colors / filters / mix-blend on logos or chrome
- Logo box resizing or swapping Wix SVG for PNG
- Navbar redesign
- Layout / spacing / animation style changes
- `opacity: 1 !important`, `transform: none !important`, or `animation: none !important` on Wix motion comps
- Empty `{}` overwrites of `thunderbolt-features--*--desktop--*.json` for pages that need motion data

**Allowed (content / behavior only):**

- Footer **link labels and hrefs** (keep per-page footer colors + clone fonts/icons)
- Text/copy updates that do not change typography
- Form submit wiring
- Hiding owner-rejected sections with collapse-only CSS
- Mobile-only work inside `@media (max-width: 1024px)` / `matchMedia('(max-width: 1024px)')`

## Files that must stay no-op for desktop visuals

- `public/css/tsc-desktop-nav-lock.css` — intentionally empty / no-op
- Do not reintroduce logo size/filter rules in `tsc-components.js` `injectDesktopNavLockInline` or `tsc-responsive.css`

## Media crops

Hero / cropped assets must use Wix CDN crop URLs (`static.wixstatic.com/media/.../v1/...`),
proxied by `scripts/serve-mirror.js` and `vercel.json` — never substitute uncropped `original-media`.

## Agent rules

1. Never modify desktop markup/styles of the 9 primaries for “polish”.
2. Mobile-only changes stay in max-width 1024 guards.
3. `scripts/inject-responsive-assets.js` stays a no-op.
4. After any change that could touch these pages, verify desktop at 1280px before finishing.
5. After motion-related edits: `node artifacts/_verify-motion-all-pages.mjs` (expect `failed:0`).
6. See `docs/FORMS_GUIDE.md` for form destinations (Taskmaster — not Sheets).
7. Do not bump / clear `DESKTOP_LOCK.json` unless the owner re-opens the lock.
